#sortorder:4
#showas:难度 6 + 人类抵抗军
Not too complicated.  It's mostly just you and the AI, and it's set to difficulty 6.  Harder still than the previous scenario, and good if you're starting to get experienced. At this point, the AI is definitely getting some of the possible tricks, but not quite there.

This is on the "realistic" map type, with 80 planets.  Simple Ensemble AI type. Basic as you get!  Your starting fleet is set to "Classic," which has the most basic available options.

Since this is starting to get a bit higher in the difficulty, you have some allies in the form of the Human Resistance Fighters, that will occasionally appear in a battle to help you for free, then leave after.